# 20. Integration With CP-AUTO-005

CP-AUTO-006 should be composable with CP-AUTO-005.

Eventually:

```text
CyberPivot Content Assurance
        │
        ├── File / Frontmatter Validator
        ├── Style Validator
        ├── Scenario Validator
        ├── Lab / Cabinet Validator
        └── Future AI Reviewer
```

Each component produces the same finding structure.

The overall runner combines those results into the CP-AUTO-004 run-level result.

CP-AUTO-006 should not create a second output format.

